      "message": "Let’s trace how new_util is got.\n\nunsigned long min_util \u003d boosted_task_util(p)\nunsigned long wake_util, new_util;\nwake_util \u003d cpu_util_wake(i, p);\nnew_util \u003d wake_util + task_util(p);\nnew_util \u003d max(min_util, new_util);\n\nDoes it make sense to use “new_util” to check overutilization. \n“new_util” may be boosted task utilization instead of real task utilization.\nHow about taking “wake_util + task_util(p)” to check overutilization?",
